%% Offline workout logging sequence (UML sequence, informal)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Member
  participant UI as Train UI
  participant EX as Experience engine
  participant D as fs_domain training
  participant DB as Drift
  participant OB as Outbox
  M->>UI: Start guided workout (mode full_after)
  UI->>D: resolve schedule (enrollment, lift days, date)
  D-->>UI: prescription snapshot with RPE and deload
  UI->>DB: insert session in_progress, lease, uuid v7
  UI->>EX: WorkoutStateChanged(warming_up)
  loop each set
    M->>UI: enter load and reps
    UI->>DB: update set (committed before UI confirms)
    UI->>EX: WorkoutStateChanged(resting, remaining)
    EX-->>UI: optional rest prompt (no input, dismissible)
  end
  Note over UI,DB: App killed -> ResumeSessionGuard restores session from Drift
  M->>UI: Finish
  UI->>DB: session finished, revision 1
  UI->>OB: enqueue set users/uid/sessions/id and create checkin fact
  UI->>EX: WorkoutStateChanged(finished)
  EX-->>UI: after-workout stages now available
